@kathytafel I think there is a fierce regression in Xcode 27 Beta 3 that causes this issue. I assume Xcode just skips the permission step and thus is never authenticated. We're also seeing this with a different configuration. I keep using Beta 2 because of this issue. See attachment on how this permission dialog should look like whenever starting a new conversation.

It's just my interpretation but I assume this issue is unrelated to OpenCode.

